{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"znmW7djuEJjlMI0hw-utEw","review_id":"Rd-bimrQKKxgZrsl-_5UBw","date":"2017-12-02T04:02:30","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9296488165855408,"text_excerpt":"Great place to get some to-go chinese food. Not much of a sit down and eat atmosphere. Im a pretty simple chinese food eater, so i usually get the sesame chicken or general tso chicken which are both pretty good & flavorful. Like most people rant about on here, they offer very nice portions of whatever you decide to order. They also have very convenient late night hours which they stay open usually til 10:30pm. They are actually right down the street from me which makes it 100 times better for me. Haha!"},{"business_id":"znmW7djuEJjlMI0hw-utEw","review_id":"Lc17wY-SInreijuwwp6P0w","date":"2005-07-11T05:32:47","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9176712036132812,"text_excerpt":"Red Star is easily the best of the cheaper Chinese places, and despite their location they deliver all over the city. These are New York guys who moved down here and opened a restaurant, and you can taste the difference. They have a very interesting take on General's Chicken that i'm a big fan of. Everything spicy is best when made \"extra extra extra\" spicy."},{"business_id":"znmW7djuEJjlMI0hw-utEw","review_id":"HoiebK0KLoWevBrj7MTl5g","date":"2007-02-28T14:07:39","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9121594429016113,"text_excerpt":"Ok. As long as you remember to tell them to put the sauce on the side, it's great! Yeah, I'm not a fan of sauce. But I think the eggrolls, though a bit greasy, are pretty fucking awesome; they have a flaky outside- yum! And it's pretty fucking cheap compared to Five Happiness. And I definitely recommend this place fore those that want some good cheap Chinese food. Not to mention, because they cater to a college crowd, they are open somewhat late/later. And they do deliever."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"znmW7djuEJjlMI0hw-utEw","photo_id":"XANDRlVRIfrfFgmG89E36g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/XANDRlVRIfrfFgmG89E36g.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0000001192092896}]},"notebook_case":null}
